Welcome to TUI Inventory.

I love open source and a good TUI/CLI program. A good TUI/CLI is versatile and timeless.

This is an attempt at a simple Inventory Management System that a user can custom build to their needs.
Tracking inventory in a spreadsheet seems a little too primitive and data bases can be a little daunting for the average user. All the data is stored in a CSV or simple text file so things can be easily imported into a spreadsheet if needed. You can hopefully make this program your own. 

You can: 
* Change the theme colour 
* Change the programs name and subtitle 
* Customize what gets asked when creating an item 
* Create custom fields to suit your need
* Dictate how and what is displayed on screen. 
* Turn your history into some simple sales tracking if you turn on Monetization.
* Run several instances by placing the main python file into a different folder and launching fromfrom there. 
* Overwrite this About page it make it about what ever your tracking.

I am not a coder. I've been waiting for someone to make an app like this for years. Thanks to ai it has been prompted it into existence. I give as a gift. Don't like or want it; don't take it. 
For those taking the gift; do what you want with it. Hopefully smarter people then I can make it better.
If you feel you've have done better pass it on as open source as it was given.

Good Luck.

